1
00:00:00,130 --> 00:00:02,570
Ever complained about your mom's
cooking?

2
00:00:02,610 --> 00:00:03,350
I did.

3
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:04,480
Big mistake.

4
00:00:05,250 --> 00:00:09,160
Then I found out how people got
dinner ten thousand years ago.

5
00:00:14,100 --> 00:00:15,210
No fridge.

6
00:00:15,610 --> 00:00:16,810
No delivery.

7
00:00:17,260 --> 00:00:18,870
Not even a microwave!

8
00:00:19,140 --> 00:00:20,450
I chased my food,

9
00:00:20,520 --> 00:00:22,520
got chased BY my food…

10
00:00:22,560 --> 00:00:25,610
and somehow burned a potato.

11
00:00:27,100 --> 00:00:29,370
Then suddenly… I was back home.

12
00:00:30,840 --> 00:00:33,480
MOM: So… how's the chicken?

13
00:00:33,570 --> 00:00:35,830
ME: BEST MEAL OF MY LIFE!

14
00:00:35,980 --> 00:00:38,280
MOM: It's yesterday's leftovers.

15
00:00:38,550 --> 00:00:39,780
ME: Even better.
